Author: Chanwoo <99chanwoo@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Apr 20 08:04:29 2026 +0000

    [sprint6-nodeA] T2 Sprint-6 integration (Phase 2.3-2.6)
    
    Four files touched — wires r_judge/r_solve into NeMo-RL training loop.
    
    1. nemo_rl/data/datasets/response_datasets/geometry3k.py
       - format_geometry3k_dataset now emits ground_truth as JSON envelope:
         {'question', 'image_b64', 'answer', '_format': 'sprint6_v1'}
       - Image is base64-encoded PNG (self-contained, no file I/O per sample)
       - Backward-compatible: Sprint-5 per-sample rewards ignore envelope
    
    2. nemo_rl/environments/rewards.py
       - _BATCH_REWARD_NAMES = {'svg_judge_group', 'svg_solve_aux'}
       - _parse_gt_payload: safe JSON envelope parser (None if not v1 format)
       - _run_group_calls: shared async runner — groups indices by gt string,
         fires ALL groups concurrently via single asyncio.gather (PLAN C.4
         fire-all-gather), scatters back to original positions
       - svg_judge_group_scores + svg_solve_aux_scores: batch-level adapters
         with graceful degrade to [0]*n on any exception
    
    3. nemo_rl/environments/vlm_environment.py
       - VLMVerifyWorker.__init__ now separates per-sample pairs from batch pairs
       - verify() does per-sample loop first, then one call per batch reward
         (NOT one call per group — batch reward internally groups)
       - Joint renormalization: weighted sum / total_weight for final score
       - No-batch case keeps Sprint-5 behavior exactly (verify_func unchanged)
    
    4. examples/configs/grpo_geometry3k_judge.yaml (NEW)
       - Inherits grpo_geometry3k.yaml (Sprint-5 winner)
       - Overrides: max_input 4096 (C.2), max_total 6144 (C.12 mem budget),
         max_new 1024, save_period 5, max_num_steps 25 (PoC)
       - Reward mix: fmt=0.2, judge=0.4, solve=0.4 (static, no curriculum yet)
       - TODO: wire reward_schedule curriculum (C.3) — left for Phase 2
         follow-up; current behavior uses static weights throughout
    
    Import smoke test passes (no circular imports, _parse_gt_payload correct).
    No full-run smoke yet — that's T3.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

